  "targetAge": 15,
  "scale": "1/72",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『境界戦機 極鋼ノ装鬼』（きょうかいせんき きょっこうのそうき）より、武装と支援機を合わせた「境界戦機ウェポンセット8」が登場！",
      "en": "From ``Kyoukai Senki Kyokko no Souki'' comes the ``Kyoukai Senki Weapon Set 8'', which combines weapons and support aircraft!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• AMAIM輸送用車両「ドレッドノータス」とガトリングガン、ミサイルランチャー、スモークディスチャージャーなどの武装をまとめたセット。",
      "en": "• A set that includes the AMAIM transport vehicle \"Dreadnoughtus\" and weapons such as a Gatling gun, missile launcher, and smoke discharger."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ドレッドノータスは拡張性を重視しカスタマイズ用の３mm径の接続穴を各所に配置。",
      "en": "• Dreadnoughtus emphasizes expandability and has 3mm diameter connection holes placed throughout for customization."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• タイヤの回転、車両後方の荷台ゲート部分の展開など各種ギミックを再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduce various gimmicks such as rotating tires and deploying the loading platform gate at the rear of the vehicle."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ミサイルランチャーには機体への装備も可能なグリップも付属。",
      "en": "• The missile launcher also comes with a grip that can be attached to the aircraft."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
